# OpenRedius local dictionary (docs/04 compiler group-level markers).
#
# OpenRedius-Flags mirrors the policy flags (mac/edr/time/cert) into
# radgroupcheck for operator visibility; the runtime policy enforcement
# reads the app DB view (docs/06), so this attribute is control-only and
# never sent on the wire.

ATTRIBUTE	OpenRedius-Flags	3000	string
# String mirror of reply:Class (Class is octets; rlm_sql would store it as
# 0x-hex). Carries the failure reason into radpostauth.class (docs/06 归类).
ATTRIBUTE	OpenRedius-Deny-Reason	3001	string
